# A 375 KB x86-64 ELF shared object was committed here as "core.py" (commit
# e208416, "XX"). The `*.so` rule above did not catch it because of the
# extension, and `packages=['ciostream']` then copied it into EVERY wheel --
# including macOS, Windows and aarch64 ones. It is listed by name so the same
# build artifact cannot be committed again.
src/ciostream/core.py
